  "ja233:0.4": "233. Vikaṇṇajātakaṃ (2-9-3) 165. ",
  "ja233:1.1": "Kāmaṃ yahiṃ icchasi tena gaccha, ",
  "ja233:1.2": "viddhosi mammamhi vikaṇṇakena; ",
  "ja233:1.3": "Hatosi bhattena suvāditena , ",
  "ja233:1.4": "lolo ca macche anubandhamāno. ",
  "ja233:2.1": "166. Evampi lokāmisaṃ opatanto, ",
  "ja233:2.2": "vihaññatī cittavasānuvattī; ",
  "ja233:2.3": "So haññati ñātisakhāna majjhe, ",
  "ja233:2.4": "macchānugo soriva suṃsumāroti . ",
  "ja233:3.1": "Vikaṇṇajātakaṃ tatiyaṃ. "
}
